1. **Kilo Code** (May 5, 2026) - Open-source VS Code extension with parallel AI agents, achieved #1 Product of the Day and Week on Product Hunt

2. **Latitude for Claude Code** (May 13, 2026) - Token observability platform for Claude Code, ranked #2 Product of the Day

3. **CraftBot with Living UI** (May 13, 2026) - Self-hosted AI assistant with living UI that can build custom apps, ranked #3 Product of the Day

4. **Stagent** (May 13, 2026) - Workflow orchestration for Claude Code using state machines (plan → verify → review → ship)

5. **Agent FM for Claude Code & Codex** (May 13, 2026) - Open-source Mac app for real-time monitoring of parallel AI agents

6. **Apideck MCP Server** (May 13, 2026) - MCP server giving AI agents access to 200+ SaaS integrations

### Key Trends:
- **Claude Code ecosystem dominance**: 4 out of 6 products are built specifically for Claude Code
- **Observability focus**: Multiple tools focused on monitoring and tracking AI agent behavior
- **Parallel agent workflows**: Tools emerging to manage multiple AI agents working simultaneously
- **Open-source momentum**: Strong presence of open-source alternatives to commercial tools

